  "name": "Question 10",
  "problem": "Which set is equivalent to $A={x\\in R:3{x}^{2}+27=0}?$",
  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the real numbers that satisfy the equation $3{x}^{2}+27=0.$ \n\nSo, we first need to solve our equation for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}+27 & =0 \\\\ 3{x}^{2} & =-27 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =-9 \\\\ x & =\\pm \\sqrt{-9} \\\\ x & =\\pm 3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, since $x\\in R$ and $\\pm 3\\text{i}\\notin R,$ we conclude that the set $A$ contains no elements. Hence, $A=\u2205.$",
